This repository hosts architecture-diagram icons redistributed from multiple
upstream sources, used in architecture diagrams, training materials, and
documentation:

  - Microsoft Azure architecture icons (via the plantuml-stdlib/Azure-PlantUML
    upstream redistribution, MIT).
  - Microsoft Fabric icons (via the @fabric-msft/svg-icons npm package,
    published by Microsoft Corporation under MIT).
  - Kubernetes icons (via kubernetes/community, CNCF / Linux Foundation,
    Apache-2.0 OR CC-BY-4.0 dual grant).
  - Microsoft FluentUI System Icons (via microsoft/fluentui-system-icons,
    published by Microsoft Corporation under MIT).
  - Devicon dev-tool icons (via devicons/devicon, community-maintained, MIT,
    Copyright (c) 2015 konpa).
  - AWS architecture icons (via awslabs/aws-icons-for-plantuml, CC-BY-ND 2.0 —
    redistributed verbatim, no modification or resize).
  - Google Cloud icons (via the official Google Cloud Icon Library, used for
    reference in architecture diagrams under Google's brand guidelines).

This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by Microsoft Corporation, the
Cloud Native Computing Foundation, the Linux Foundation, Amazon Web Services,
Google LLC, the Devicon project, or any of the third-party brands whose
